Advanced Numeric Pattern Generator
Aim: Generate a hollow diamond numeric pattern based on the user's input and validate the dimensions.
Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Enter the size of the diamond.
3. Check whether the size is a positive integer.
4. Print the upper half of the diamond using numbers and spaces.
5. Print the lower half in reverse order.
6. Display the complete hollow diamond.
7. Stop.
Flowchart
Start
↓
Enter diamond size n
↓
Is n greater than 0?
↓
No
↓
